    "hints": {
      "slug": "Stable key agents use to call this AR. Shared by every version of the family.",
      "authorityRelation": "The ARF tuple: <strong>who</strong> (actor role + signing identity) may perform which <strong>action</strong> on which <strong>object</strong>.",
      "domainContext": "The evaluable predicate: the context (threshold, currency, market) this authority holds in. Criteria are evaluated against it.",
      "dnaMaxThreshold": "The divergence ceiling. The DNA-Coefficient measures how far past decisions <strong>diverge</strong> from this rule (0.0 = perfect match, higher = worse). The AR can be activated only while its measured value stays at or below this ceiling; an active AR that later drifts above it is auto-flagged <strong>Needs Review</strong>.",
      "mcpResolverCredentials": "<strong>OBO:</strong> MCP tools run with the caller's own permissions; a caller without a forwarded token gets no_authority. <strong>App service principal:</strong> tools run as the Ontos app for every caller, so the result no longer depends on who is asking. Only use this when the tool must see data callers cannot.",
      "mcpNoCallerToken": "No caller token was forwarded, so this list was fetched as the Ontos app service principal. Callers of an OBO-authenticated AR may not have access to these services."
    },
